ay: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          Pomelo, Cranberry, Red plum\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          在上一只改良铁皮卡卖完后，又有机会拿到了农场的Sidra水洗，这一只水洗非常的甜美细腻，柑橘，柚子转红色莓果和核果，在养豆时间久的批次里还能喝到类似香蕉和黄苹果的果香，很特别～喜欢～\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Tia6593icv0lvf4dHREGOfbmAfP622IA0ctib7XLruCiaic1fylcq16UlTRsAfTqJ7ic2yrts31yszWxsw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;outline: 0px;width: 678px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 14px;\">\n          洛哈在厄瓜多尔的南部\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 14px;\">\n          图片来源\n          <a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.cafeimports.com/europe/ecuador\" style=\"outline: 0px;cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\" wah-hotarea=\"click\">\n           CAFE IMPORT\n          </a>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaHn143rJWT4O90OO5FdoZiaTjOianhWibAefia23tt0bxAXdsk7wAVBMVtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           San Pedro de Vilcabamba Valley位于Gonzanama东边，横跨了Gonzanama,Catamayo和Loja3个小区域\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于养豆、储存和冲煮\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于侯爵夫人农场\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          侯爵夫人农场（La Marquesa） 坐落于圣佩德罗-维尔卡巴巴山谷（San Pedro de Vilcabamba Valley），其特色为富含铁、镁等矿物质的火山土壤，且受到邻近国家保护区公园的影响，拥有独特的微气候。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOla1VwYHOtwq6GFhGbPkg8ecaI6PNh04iaAP9hx4EcChuLoQZulVmGCmrA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          该农场一直是栽种传统铁皮卡的农场，已有七十多年的历史，于六年前家族决定栽种新的改良铁皮卡品种，旨在使其优良基因能在杯中中得到更好地体现。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          在过去的两年间，得益于更优的品种、组织、工作规划以及施肥计划（尤以有机肥料为甚），农场的质量获得了极大的提升。现今，其面积达 5 公顷，其中重要种植改良铁皮卡，其次是希爪和瑰夏。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaybbJ2NZt9jyJkQxk5UXvL6dq02ibVn0rxEagPlNBYBia7yiaV7iaVtK3Yg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           阿尔伯蒂娜·托莱多今年 82 岁，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           身为九个兄弟姐妹中的老么，她一生都全心全意地照顾父母。待其父母离世后，她搬至农场，自那时起便一直在农场劳作。她始终负责照看农作物、为每日采收\n          </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           的咖啡樱桃称重、支付薪资并为所有工人准备午餐。\n          </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            西米娜和休伯特如今照顾着她，因为她已无法再工作，她过着宁静的生活，每日都能看到她的咖啡种植园在成长，这正是阿尔贝蒂娜所热爱的生活。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaibP1uI1ALDzos1Um8E7YomkhoQeFOId2bhqW08qN9J0hg8miaibCtbgUQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          商务摆拍中的\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           Ximena～哈哈哈～是我看到图片就蹦出来的感觉，真实图片是如何场景下拍摄的俺不晓得\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOladLa7BaJpicDv3hlq2Z5GPCN6NIJllmiaNo4Ok3X4Eb1RWcX5ruoZGRrA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          工作中严肃的\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           Ximena\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            西米娜作为第三代咖啡生产者，她专注于打造更为有序的农场，注重质量而非数量。她与休伯特不仅仅只是种植，还想要自己烘焙和冲煮咖啡，整个流程都在他们自己的农场中进行。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          西米娜的丈夫休伯特是咖啡加工与脫壳方面的行家，亦是厄瓜多尔CoE卓越杯的评委；今年他们决定参与此次CoE卓越杯比赛，并凭借一只水洗处理的Sidra获得第 17 名。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOla4S8OicJ4C0vAVlATe18I8qfLkUyIRYHNhpLhRhlbEDxO2bC5nnnZvpQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          成就：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          • 凭借 希爪水洗 （Sidra Washed） 荣获 2023 年全国冠军，在 2023 年CoE国际赛段中位列第 17，得分 86.79。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          • 注册为“Denomination Café De Origen Loja”作为试点农场，并成为首位使用其标识的农场。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           关于厌氧水洗批次处理方式\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          收集Brix为20-22%的咖啡鲜果，用盐消毒，挤压果肉后厌氧发酵24\n         </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          小时，然后清洗后，接种乳酸菌以保持发酵的一\n         </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          致性。发酵48小时后彻底清洗干净。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          晾晒时，在阳光下日晒4个小时，然后放置在透光率为50%的遮篷下。整个干\n         </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          燥过程一般需要18-20天。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
